==============================================================================
Repo-facing claims
==============================================================================
1. Raw diagonalization is a missing-object move; Borel-style anti-diagonalization is an invariant-selector obstruction.
2. Constructive mathematics enters as named finite procedures: least outside point, bounded search, and explicit closure sequences.
3. Tangible incompleteness is the uniform version: finite stages are transparent, but the extension bound/rank can outrun the base theory.
4. Embedded maximality is the repair: state which ambient extensions are allowed and which address makes the selector/maximal object stable.
5. LRC14 transfer: owner-private deletion is an address tax already paid; the next theorem is a recursive rank drop on coherent +27 carry lifts.
